      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For context/clarification: The 1st picture in OP (`5c3fa59967fbf797140106e094748313.png`) was from an instance hosted by a VRChat developer/admin ([TCL](https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_a2b466d1-82c5-4809-8532-5772fb03c51d) / [TCL987](https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_3a02fc12-2948-4585-b3e1-2000ca5e9f6f)) in the group named [Instance Capacity Stress Tests (MAXCAP.0939)](https://vrc.group/MAXCAP.0939), in [1's Optimized Box](https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_1a8b8684-3b19-4770-a4a7-288762f57b29) world as part of a Featured event. These instances had a maximum population cap of 999 players.\n\nThe queued items on the floor in that picture were Campfires, as seen spawning in `961385b935efcadcf536b06703aa21c9.png` (2nd picture). Those were queued, and should've not have spawned in OP's home world.",
