  "details": "BIG BIG NOTE: This was during the capacity stress test to give extra context\n\n1. Joined the instance\n\n2. Items got stuck loading saying \"Queued\"\n\n3. Got disconnected from \"The VRChat Anti-Cheat system has failed too many times for you lately.\" (2025.12.01 22:44:01)\n\n4. I get booted back to my homeworld\n\n5. All the items that were queued in the previous world spawn in as soon as I join\n\nImages and game log attached",
